    "k": 10,
    "pool": "publishable metros (every component at both endpoints) with a pooled vector, restricted before selection",
    "pooling": "employment-weighted mean of 2019 county vectors, re-normalized, w_c = the county's 2019 QCEW total covered employment; composition from the Jul 2023 sheet, the one in force for the outcome year 2025 (SPEC 4.2) and the delineation CES uses; the same rule for every rung",
